      "versionNonce": 1628053872,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773417438275,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# Understand Match\nGiven an array of strings strs, group all anagrams together into sublists.\nYou may return the output in any order.\nAn anagram is a string that contains the exact same characters as another string, \nbut the order of the characters can be different.\n\n## question\n- What's the expected size of the input? Both the array length and string length?\n-> constaints\n\n- Can I assume the strings contain only lowercase English letters?(Are strings case-sensitive?)\n-> Only lowercase.\n\n- Can the input array be empty?\n-> Not at all.\n\n## happy path\n- strs = [\"ai\", \"ia\"] res = [[\"ai\", \"ia\"]]\n- strs = [\"eat\", \"tea\", \"tan\", \"ate\", \"nat\", \"bat\"] res = [[\"eat\", \"tea\", \"ate\"], [\"tan\", \"nat\"], [\"bat\"]]\n\n## edge case\n- strs = [\"a\"] res = [[\"a\"]]\n- strs = [\"\"] res = [[\"\"]]\n\n## constraints\n1 <= strs.length <= 1000\n0 <= strs[i].length <= 100",
      "fontSize": 22.204892648871525,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# Understand Match\nGiven an array of strings strs, group all anagrams together into sublists.\nYou may return the output in any order.\nAn anagram is a string that contains the exact same characters as another string, \nbut the order of the characters can be different.\n\n## question\n- What's the expected size of the input? Both the array length and string length?\n-> constaints\n\n- Can I assume the strings contain only lowercase English letters?(Are strings case-sensitive?)\n-> Only lowercase.\n\n- Can the input array be empty?\n-> Not at all.\n\n## happy path\n- strs = [\"ai\", \"ia\"] res = [[\"ai\", \"ia\"]]\n- strs = [\"eat\", \"tea\", \"tan\", \"ate\", \"nat\", \"bat\"] res = [[\"eat\", \"tea\", \"ate\"], [\"tan\", \"nat\"], [\"bat\"]]\n\n## edge case\n- strs = [\"a\"] res = [[\"a\"]]\n- strs = [\"\"] res = [[\"\"]]\n\n## constraints\n1 <= strs.length <= 1000\n0 <= strs[i].length <= 100",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
